      "en": {
        "name": "MSV Gen.2 plate carrier (General Purpose)",
        "shortName": "MSV GP",
        "description": "The Modular Scalable Vest (MSV) Gen.2 is the main body armor of the U.S. Army, designed to carry heavy armor and equipment loads by utilising modern technology and load-bearing developments compared to the IOTV that it replaces. Configured with an Assault Pouch setup."

      }
    },
